
# fal's request-history dumps carry `auth_method: key=<the API key>` on every
# record. They are useful for recovering a lost render and must never be
# committed — gitleaks caught 46 of them on 2026-09-18.
_fal_requests.json
_omni_requests.json
*_requests.json

# Generated media lives on Drive (md5-verified), not in git. This repo's .git
# is already 3.8 GB; a 16 MB reference video that is also file id
# 1jTFDDm3f8MLVGubSo9xubIyX8AYJCR47 has no business being in both places.
# Keep the small evidence JPGs - those are the argument, not the asset.
*.mp4
*.mp3
avatar/*.png
voicelib/*.mp3
tts/*.mp3
out/*.mp4
t1/*

